WEBVTT

00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:03.510
The year is 20XX.

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:12.340
The world was engulfed 
in the flame of cats.

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:16.100
The school was destroyed, 
its rooms buried beneath the earth,

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:19.740
and it seemed that all of the 
students had met their end!

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:21.160
However...

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.880
The Astronomy Club survived!

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:29.790
"As The South Star Fades, 
The North Star Appears!"

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:34.010
It seems I was destined to 
fight you, after all...

00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:36.010
Izumiko!

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:47.450
Itsuki-sama... Where are you?

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:33.070
<b>This is the Agonizing Astronomy Club of Miracles! A Maid has Landed!</b>

00:02:38.360 --> 00:02:40.760
Math

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:41.790
This is hell!

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:45.010
The test's finally over...

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:45.010
Why doesn't god give 
freedom to the weak?!

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:46.510
You have to believe!

00:02:46.510 --> 00:02:49.020
Believe that there will 
always be a bright tomorrow!

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:06.300
So you've come... Izumiko.

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:08.670
Onee-sama, where is he?

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:10.160
Give it a rest.

00:03:10.650 --> 00:03:12.850
Your rotten desires are petty

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:16.010
compared to the full weight 
of my Astronomy Club.

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:18.920
Return to your own school.

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:24.070
What...

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.270
This shelter that we call our clubroom

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:29.030
can only fit one other person.

00:03:29.030 --> 00:03:32.900
If we pack it tight,
maybe two at the most.

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:35.900
You're trying to take everything 
for yourself again...

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:38.650
Hm? I can't hear you.

00:03:39.220 --> 00:03:42.070
Let me ask you something,
since you want to enter so badly.

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:43.460
Have you seen the Blue Star

00:03:43.460 --> 00:03:45.780
that shines to the side 
of the Big Dipper?

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:46.700
I have!

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:49.160
You have, have you?

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:52.830
In that case, know that is our fate!

00:04:03.490 --> 00:04:05.850
Huh? Izumiko-chan?

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:07.890
She came to see Todayama again?

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:09.180
No.

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:14.440
I came to search for a man 
that goes to this school.

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:15.260
Damn.

00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:16.460
His name is...

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:17.940
Good morning!

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:21.380
Oh, you're here again.

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:25.380
Oh, hi there, Noya-san.

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:26.820
Sorry I'm late.

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:28.540
I'll get changed right away.

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:31.460
Noya-san.

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:33.860
Itsuki-sama!

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:35.420
Huh?

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:37.170
Itsuki... sama?

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:38.000
What is it?

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:48.760
Itsuki-sama...

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:52.740
Huh?

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:55.770
Now say my name!

00:04:55.770 --> 00:05:00.150
E-Elizabeth Margaret...

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:01.700
Good job.

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:01.950
Elizabeth...

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:03.650
...Margaret?

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:07.320
I finally found you.

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:11.300
Where have you been this 
whole time, Itsuki-sama?

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:14.540
Noya-san comes to the 
Astronomy Club all the time.

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:15.330
Huh?

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:18.100
Yeah, Noya-kun's been 
here the whole time.

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:20.210
So you just didn't notice?

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:24.210
Here. Take a look at this.

00:05:32.830 --> 00:05:36.220
I was so entranced in trying to 
find Itsuki-sama this whole time,

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:38.720
I didn't pay attention to anything 
else going on around me.

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:42.570
I, Todayama Izumiko, 
am a complete failure.

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:45.790
S-Sorry about that, 
Elizabeth Margaret...

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:49.340
I should have said 
something to you earlier.

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:53.220
What?

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:54.330
She's slapping him again?

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:58.290
Why were you cross-dressing, 
Itsuki-sama?

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:02.290
Well, I... when I first 
joined the club...

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:07.550
Huh? The Astronomy Club is...

00:06:08.450 --> 00:06:09.510
underground?

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:13.760
<b>Agonizing Astronomy Club</b>

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:17.020
H-Hi...?

00:06:23.260 --> 00:06:25.530
Are you a first-year?

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:27.950
Do you want to join the club?

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:29.180
Y-Yeah...

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:31.180
My name is...

00:06:31.180 --> 00:06:32.830
No. Not happening.

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:33.450
Huh?

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:35.340
Get out of here. Go home.

00:06:35.340 --> 00:06:36.610
Why?

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:40.770
It's just going to be a pain 
if a guy joins, you know?

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:43.210
I mean, how are we supposed to 
go on the "Lose the Panties" diet then?

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:44.880
More nonsense.

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:46.890
It's been girls this whole 
time, and if a guy comes,

00:06:46.890 --> 00:06:48.650
we won't be able to have the secret

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:50.930
girl parties we've been having, so no.

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:53.220
We haven't had any parties.

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:55.520
So...

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:59.160
Only girls can join?

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:02.510
Yeah, so be gone. Leave now.

00:07:02.510 --> 00:07:04.760
We finally got someone who 
wants to join, though!

00:07:04.760 --> 00:07:06.610
If only he weren't male.

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:09.470
The vice-president is 
going to complain if we

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:10.880
turn away someone just 'cause.

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:15.520
You had a student who loves 
astronomy come here,

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:17.490
and you turned them away?

00:07:18.860 --> 00:07:22.460
How about giving him 
a chance, at least?

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:30.820
Uh... I'm sorry.

00:07:32.850 --> 00:07:33.650
Huh?

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:36.640
What? What, what, what, 
what, what are you...

00:07:41.510 --> 00:07:43.690
Now pick a place!

00:07:43.050 --> 00:07:44.820
H-Hey, Todayama!

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:45.970
That will be where you change!

00:07:45.970 --> 00:07:46.850
Huh?

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:51.160
The second you wear these clothes,

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:52.550
Todayama! P-Please stop!

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:52.580
we'll recognize you as a girl!

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:53.320
Stop!

00:07:55.370 --> 00:08:00.040
S-So you'll really let me join 
the club if I wear this?

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:04.560
Humans only use thirty percent 
of their potential strength,

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:06.900
but the true purpose for 
our Astronomy Club is

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:09.670
to awaken the remaining 
seventy percent.

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:12.420
Just think of cross-dressing 
as the first step to that!

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:15.030
F-Fine...

00:08:17.800 --> 00:08:21.060
Ever since then, I've 
done what they told me

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:23.270
and cross-dress when 
I'm in the clubroom.

00:08:24.010 --> 00:08:25.700
If you're going to take 
part in our club,

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:27.620
then pledging your loyalty 
goes without saying!

00:08:27.620 --> 00:08:29.370
The weak should vanish.

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:32.250
That is the rule by which those 
that know the North Star live!

00:08:34.010 --> 00:08:37.590
I feel... so bad for you, Itsuki-sama.

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:42.050
Now, say my name one more time.

00:08:42.570 --> 00:08:44.920
Elizabeth Margaret.

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:46.320
Well said.

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:47.440
Who's this Elizabeth 
supposed to be, anyway?

00:08:47.930 --> 00:08:51.190
Itsuki-sama, place both of 
your palms on the ground.

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:51.760
Huh?

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:52.920
Like this?

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:54.930
Thank you.

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:57.960
Hidebu!

00:08:58.960 --> 00:09:00.470
You're unsteady.

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:02.360
If you move, your legs will waiver.

00:09:02.360 --> 00:09:04.020
S-Sorry...

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:09.450
All of you are being quite arrogant.

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:11.860
Do you know who this individual is?

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:17.450
He is the next successor to 
the Noya Financial Group,

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:19.340
Noya Itsuki-sama.

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:24.710
And if you're standing on him, 
who does that make you?!

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:27.830
Me? I am...

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:36.490
His maid, Elizabeth Margaret!

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:38.950
What?!

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:40.530
So Noya-san really is the

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:42.850
heir to the Noya Financial Group...

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:46.420
There was a rumor going around

00:09:46.420 --> 00:09:48.770
that he would be transferring 
into our school.

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:51.380
I thought it could 
possibly be him, but...

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:53.680
The Noya Financial group

00:09:53.680 --> 00:09:56.760
is one of the most well-known 
families out there.

00:09:56.760 --> 00:09:58.670
And Itsuki-sama will be the one to

00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:00.270
be its heir and inherit everything—

00:10:00.270 --> 00:10:01.530
truly a modern day Polaris.

00:10:01.970 --> 00:10:03.810
You could call him an emperor.

00:10:04.550 --> 00:10:06.240
Someone so important is in our club?

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:07.390
It makes sense now...

00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:09.550
Only a weirdo like that would 
try to join our club.

00:10:09.550 --> 00:10:12.230
I'm not a weirdo!

00:10:12.230 --> 00:10:13.570
No, you are.

00:10:13.570 --> 00:10:14.300
Huh?

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:18.270
The second you call a Japanese girl 
"Elizabeth," you're pretty weird.

00:10:18.270 --> 00:10:20.670
Huh? Elizabeth isn't her real name?

00:10:20.670 --> 00:10:21.650
Itsuki-sama...

00:10:23.840 --> 00:10:25.640
You mustn't waiver.

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:29.500
I will always be Elizabeth 
within your heart,

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:31.170
and only your heart.

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:33.400
I-I see!

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:35.540
Only in his heart?

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:37.710
So her name isn't Elizabeth then...

00:10:37.710 --> 00:10:40.120
Th-Then what about you 
being an English queen,

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:41.870
and that even if you're my maid,

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:43.240
you still have more pull than me?

00:10:44.050 --> 00:10:46.390
I'm sorry about that, Itsuki-sama.

00:10:46.390 --> 00:10:48.440
But trust me on this.

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:51.510
It is the Tensei of Gento

00:10:51.510 --> 00:10:53.040
that determined the truth—

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:57.530
that I am a maid who is far 
more important than you.

00:10:58.410 --> 00:11:00.890
Yeah, right... Who'd belie—

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:01.870
That makes sense.

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:02.890
He believed her?!

00:11:03.170 --> 00:11:08.080
Yes. That's why all you have to 
do is obey me, Itsuki-sama.

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:10.770
Okay, Elizabeth!

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:13.460
So basically Todayama's sister is

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:16.180
just as much of a 
weirdo as her sister...

00:11:16.840 --> 00:11:18.530
We're not anything alike!

00:11:28.510 --> 00:11:32.080
Oomori Shouko's Happy Happy Cooking!

00:11:29.350 --> 00:11:32.080
Oomori Shouko's

00:11:29.350 --> 00:11:32.080
<b>Happy Happy Cooking</b>

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.080
Take Back Your Love

00:11:33.240 --> 00:11:37.630
Today's recipe will capture 
your boyfriend's heart!

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:40.310
Everyone loves this lunch!

00:11:40.310 --> 00:11:42.090
That's looking good.

00:11:42.450 --> 00:11:46.080
Iseda-san, who will you 
be giving that to?

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:48.350
N-No one specifically.

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:50.350
<b>Hasumi</b>

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:51.760
O-Oh yeah.

00:11:51.760 --> 00:11:53.210
You know the strange incidents that

00:11:53.210 --> 00:11:55.470
are going on around the school, right?

00:11:55.470 --> 00:11:57.790
Do they have something to 
do with the Astronomy Club?

00:11:57.790 --> 00:12:01.190
Yes, I'll be giving 
one to my boyfriend.

00:12:01.190 --> 00:12:03.250
I make them every day.

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:05.120
That wasn't what I was asking...

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:07.370
All done!

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:10.580
I have to go give this to my boyfriend!

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:11.410
Let's go!

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:14.720
Someone strike one of that airhead 
advisor's Channeling Points.

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:16.610
Oomori Shouko's

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:16.610
<b>Happy Cooking</b>

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:16.610
<b>See You Next Time?</b>

00:12:23.210 --> 00:12:25.760
Wh-What are they doing?

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:28.890
I finally was able to see you again,

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:31.230
so I wanted to do something for you.

00:12:35.320 --> 00:12:37.360
Here you are, Itsuki-sama.

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:38.570
Thank you.

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:40.640
Those are some expensive looking 
eating utensils.

00:12:40.640 --> 00:12:43.220
They probably belong to 
the Noya Financial Group.

00:12:43.220 --> 00:12:44.030
No.

00:12:44.980 --> 00:12:46.870
These are mine.

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:48.210
Really?

00:12:48.210 --> 00:12:51.630
You trying to give yourself a present by

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:53.870
buying such an expensive tea set?

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:55.290
Trying to pretend like you 
actually have a life?

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:59.460
I didn't buy these for myself.

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:00.140
Huh?

00:13:00.140 --> 00:13:06.140
I just wanted Itsuki-sama to 
be surrounded by authenticity.

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:10.360
I only spend money on Itsuki-sama.

00:13:11.980 --> 00:13:14.270
You're amazing, Izumiko-chan!

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:16.060
A perfect maid.

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:24.470
Th-This is salty, Elizabeth.

00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:26.840
Yes, I added salt.

00:13:26.840 --> 00:13:28.320
Wh-Why?

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:31.280
It was once proper to 
add salt, long ago.

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:31.830
Probably.

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:33.730
What? Really?

00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:36.840
I get the feeling that was 
supposed to be for coffee...

00:13:37.280 --> 00:13:38.580
But I'm not sure.

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:41.250
<b>Salt</b>

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:43.440
Here you go, Itsuki-sama.

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:45.290
Drink up.

00:13:46.710 --> 00:13:48.520
You're not going to tell me

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:51.390
you can't drink my tea, are you?

00:13:57.900 --> 00:14:00.650
Izumiko-chan looks like 
she has a lot of fun

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:02.480
messing with Noya-kun.

00:14:04.270 --> 00:14:07.720
Izumiko, stop bothering with him.

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:10.700
I won't give him to you, 
Kyouko-oneesama!

00:14:11.060 --> 00:14:12.300
Elizabeth?

00:14:12.300 --> 00:14:13.790
You always act like this, Onee-sama!

00:14:15.340 --> 00:14:18.960
You take everything that 
is precious to me!

00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:20.880
You've always done it.

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:22.310
Always?

00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:24.710
Wh-Why are things getting so serious?

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:28.150
Hmph. What's so good about that wimp?

00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:30.470
There are more fish in the sea.

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:32.930
No. It has to be Itsuki-sama,

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:34.470
or it just won't work for me!

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:36.240
You, too!

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:39.980
Why are you trying to keep Itsuki-sama
and I apart from each other?

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:41.950
Is there some reason?

00:14:43.530 --> 00:14:45.450
No matter how much you want him,

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:47.550
he's the only thing I will not give up!

00:14:47.550 --> 00:14:51.450
Because he's... He's...

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:53.660
A toy that belongs only to me!

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:54.300
Huh?

00:14:56.070 --> 00:14:57.910
T-Toy?

00:14:57.910 --> 00:14:58.910
That's it?

00:14:58.910 --> 00:14:59.750
That's right.

00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:02.500
Now that I think about it,

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:05.800
you've taken all my fun toys 
away from me, Onee-sama.

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:08.760
That's right! My everything!

00:15:09.860 --> 00:15:11.290
Wait, Izumiko.

00:15:11.910 --> 00:15:14.390
You're forgetting something important.

00:15:15.180 --> 00:15:18.390
Noya joined the Astronomy 
Club by his own will!

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:19.600
What of it?

00:15:21.320 --> 00:15:24.360
That means he belongs 
to my Astronomy Club!

00:15:24.910 --> 00:15:28.360
Therefore implying that he 
belongs to me, Kyouko-sama!

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:30.740
Th-That can't be!

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:32.410
Say what you want,

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:35.270
but we live in a time upon which 
the Devil looks and smiles!

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:38.890
Wh-What are you doing?

00:15:39.670 --> 00:15:43.830
From now on, I will 
train him how I please!

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:46.950
Itsuki-sama!

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:50.540
S-Stop!

00:15:50.540 --> 00:15:52.790
I see! You're quite fit!

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:56.020
You'll make the perfect wooden doll!

00:15:58.410 --> 00:16:01.340
If I perfect my research into 
this new Channeling Point,

00:16:01.340 --> 00:16:03.810
your girliness should double!

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:06.860
No, stay away!

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:09.530
Itsuki-sama!

00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:22.900
What do you think? I'm a genius!

00:16:22.900 --> 00:16:24.330
Behold!

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:27.540
This is the new, 
stronger version of Noya!

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:29.290
How cute!

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:30.800
Why are we making him 
cross-dress again?

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:34.400
Noya should stay a girl 
member of our club!

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:36.580
I've made that decision!

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:37.810
But...

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:42.930
For the next successor of 
the Noya family to be forced

00:16:42.930 --> 00:16:44.760
to endure such embarrassment...

00:16:45.640 --> 00:16:47.820
I'll be taking Noya.

00:16:48.710 --> 00:16:51.320
I'm the only one who can 
torment Itsuki-sama!

00:16:52.480 --> 00:16:54.570
You mad?

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:58.150
But you cannot beat me!

00:16:58.150 --> 00:17:01.330
Your desire... Your level of 
tenacity is different than mine!

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:05.400
Look at how perfect this is!

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:25.620
Th-This is...

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:29.670
I did my best to stop that 
from happening, at least.

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:32.810
How resolute...

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:34.740
And for you to end up like this...

00:17:35.210 --> 00:17:36.280
I won't allow it!

00:17:38.730 --> 00:17:39.860
Why?

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:43.910
What color are your boxers?

00:17:44.650 --> 00:17:46.920
P-Polka-dot...

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:49.570
Why would the successor to the

00:17:49.570 --> 00:17:52.300
Noya house do something so halfway?

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:53.920
If you're going to cross-dress,

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:56.430
then make sure you prepare proper 
underwear when you do so!

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:57.270
What?

00:17:58.030 --> 00:17:59.190
What the hell?

00:17:59.190 --> 00:18:00.770
She's got a point.

00:18:00.770 --> 00:18:01.600
Huh?

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:02.710
If you're going to cosplay,

00:18:02.710 --> 00:18:04.430
you've gotta think about 
your panties, too.

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:06.110
Even if people can't see them!

00:18:06.920 --> 00:18:08.560
In that case, Kanamori...

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:10.810
You'll let me borrow the 
ones you're wearing now!

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:12.690
Really? Thank you! I appreciate it!

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:17.320
No! Don't take those!

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:19.400
Don't take the ones I'm wearing.

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:21.330
I've got ones specifically for cosplay!

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:22.720
Huh? What?

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:23.950
You've got more?

00:18:24.870 --> 00:18:27.460
Y-You heard me the whole time when 
you were taking those off...

00:18:28.060 --> 00:18:30.300
Where's the underwear for cosplay?

00:18:30.890 --> 00:18:32.060
Oh, here it is.

00:18:32.060 --> 00:18:32.870
Let's see.

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:35.860
Don't just go looking through there!

00:18:36.870 --> 00:18:38.090
M-My underwear!

00:18:39.440 --> 00:18:41.350
I can't reach them...

00:18:41.590 --> 00:18:46.040
If I bend down, everyone might 
be able to see up my skirt.

00:18:46.420 --> 00:18:47.850
Who cares if people see?

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:49.600
I care! Are you stupid?

00:18:50.090 --> 00:18:51.860
That's not it, Kanamori.

00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:53.670
You've just gotta say,

00:18:53.670 --> 00:18:56.240
"There's no panties, 
so it's not embarrassing!"

00:18:57.010 --> 00:18:59.280
Now's not the time to 
be making that joke!

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:00.810
These are...

00:19:00.810 --> 00:19:03.030
Something wrong with 
those striped panties?

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:04.680
Um, Hiromatsu.

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:06.350
These were bought at a 
cosplay store, right?

00:19:04.680 --> 00:19:05.340
Hm?

00:19:05.340 --> 00:19:07.330
Could you get these panties for me?

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:09.000
You might not know this, Onee-sama,

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:08.130
Don't wanna.

00:19:08.130 --> 00:19:08.970
But...

00:19:08.970 --> 00:19:10.490
If you hold your skirt between your

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:11.710
but these are pretty popular 
with male "otaku."

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:11.660
legs when you bend down,

00:19:11.660 --> 00:19:13.860
no one'll be able to see 
anything. Use your brain.

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:13.990
So basically, you'd wear 
these to show people.

00:19:13.860 --> 00:19:15.050
Oh, good point.

00:19:13.990 --> 00:19:15.050
I'd imagine.

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:17.790
Hold the skirt between my legs, and...

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:18.590
There!

00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:21.700
Wh-What's going on?

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:23.760
Kanamori, you're panicking too much.

00:19:27.490 --> 00:19:29.150
In that case, Itsuki-sama.

00:19:29.150 --> 00:19:29.810
Huh?

00:19:30.180 --> 00:19:32.270
I'm your maid, so it is also part of

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:34.570
my duties to help you 
put on your clothing.

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:36.310
Please give me your leg.

00:19:36.310 --> 00:19:38.740
Huh? U-Uh...

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:44.620
There. All finished.

00:19:45.130 --> 00:19:47.700
Itsuki-sama, please make 
sure you remember.

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:50.360
The next heir to the Noya household

00:19:50.360 --> 00:19:52.980
must remember that no 
matter what lays before him,

00:19:52.980 --> 00:19:54.630
he must finish it to completion.

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:56.490
B-But...

00:19:57.480 --> 00:19:58.800
Very well.

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:00.130
Then let us begin.

00:20:00.960 --> 00:20:04.390
Itsuki-sama has become 
more perfect by my hand.

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:07.070
Can you defeat me, Onee-sama?!

00:20:07.860 --> 00:20:11.140
I do not a require name, nor light,

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:13.990
for the only thing I desire is victory!

00:20:13.990 --> 00:20:16.020
Huh? W-Wait!

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:20.030
I have no regrets!

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:27.410
Th-That's...!

00:20:28.690 --> 00:20:33.210
Yes, it seems like our 
fight is not yet over.

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:36.770
How is that perfect?!

00:20:36.770 --> 00:20:38.820
Elizabeth!

00:20:44.320 --> 00:20:46.600
The weather looks bad.

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:48.350
Looks like it's going to rain.

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:50.100
I don't have an umbrella.

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:52.170
I have to get home fast.

00:20:52.170 --> 00:20:54.060
I've decided.

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:54.850
Hm?

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:58.400
I will join the Astronomy Club!

00:20:58.400 --> 00:20:59.800
What?!

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:02.260
Don't you go to a different school?

00:21:02.260 --> 00:21:04.440
I'll start the transfer 
process immediately!

00:21:04.440 --> 00:21:06.060
I've raised Itsuki-sama with

00:21:06.060 --> 00:21:08.720
the "whip of love" for a long time now.

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:10.080
I won't give him to anyone!

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:15.290
Dogs are faithful to whoever 
gives them food last.

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:17.460
Itsuki-sama is not a dog!

00:21:17.870 --> 00:21:19.540
Then allow me to rephrase what I said.

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:22.380
Noya belongs to my Astronomy Club!

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:24.860
That's just nonsense, 
and I'm not going to accept it!

00:21:25.690 --> 00:21:27.220
Knock it off.

00:21:28.560 --> 00:21:33.000
Noya-san is neither a dog 
nor someone's property.

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:34.770
Yeah, but...

00:21:36.130 --> 00:21:38.230
I'm sorry, did you want 
to say something?

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:40.790
Nothing will be born from 
pointless fighting.

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:42.430
That's right...

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:46.160
I do not strive for today, 
nor tomorrow, but for love!

00:21:46.600 --> 00:21:49.500
I have traveled the wilderness,

00:21:49.500 --> 00:21:52.150
and now finally feel like I've 
found another human being.

00:21:52.150 --> 00:21:56.670
Everyone, we must treat Noya-san nicer.

00:21:56.950 --> 00:21:59.960
Noya-san is an important piece 
of equipment for our club.

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:00.910
Huh?

00:22:00.910 --> 00:22:02.640
E-Equipment?

00:22:02.640 --> 00:22:07.260
People were talking about him 
being a toy, so I figured,

00:22:07.260 --> 00:22:09.260
he's more of a tool.

00:22:11.580 --> 00:22:12.940
And I finally thought...

00:22:12.940 --> 00:22:15.390
Huh? Where is Noya-kun, anyway?

00:22:16.430 --> 00:22:17.100
Huh?

00:22:17.390 --> 00:22:18.350
Itsuki-sama?

00:22:18.850 --> 00:22:20.060
Where did you go...

00:22:19.360 --> 00:22:20.210
This is...

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:20.950
Itsuki-sama!

00:22:20.950 --> 00:22:22.110
Where are you?!

00:22:21.020 --> 00:22:22.110
What's wrong?

00:22:22.110 --> 00:22:23.430
Death.

00:22:24.130 --> 00:22:28.160
Everything will soon end, 
and then a new beginning will come.

00:22:28.450 --> 00:22:29.400
I see...

00:22:29.890 --> 00:22:32.590
So Noya Itsuki isn't a toy.

00:22:32.590 --> 00:22:37.540
He might be Death itself, 
born under the Star of Misfortune.

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:38.320
Huh?

00:22:46.470 --> 00:22:49.890
Sky... Stars... Destiny...

00:22:50.380 --> 00:22:52.270
Tell me, if you have a heart.

00:22:53.040 --> 00:22:55.390
Why was I born into this world?

00:24:30.430 --> 00:24:32.280
You won't be popular 
with an untoned body!

00:24:32.280 --> 00:24:35.390
You can do 256 different exercises!

00:24:33.070 --> 00:24:35.490
256 Kinds of Exercise Programs

00:24:35.390 --> 00:24:36.780
Muscle Ebiten G!

00:24:36.780 --> 00:24:38.240
Train and survive through 
the end of the century!

00:24:38.240 --> 00:24:39.950
It's already the 21st century, though.

00:24:38.240 --> 00:24:40.030
Next Time: 
"Aim for the Stars! The Girl that Dreams of Love." 
Look forward to it!
